ional fatalities resulting from traumatic injuries were obtained from CFOI\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Cases were defined as all fatalities among persons classified as either GMWs (SOC 37-301) or first-line supervisors/managers\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Fatal injury rates were calculated for 2003--2007, rather than 2003--2008, because CFOI changed its method\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"These fatal injury rates are employment-based.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}